            <ArticleTitle>Nursing and supporting patients with chronic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>60-5; quiz 66</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Nurses in all settings are likely to be working with patients in chronic pain on a regular basis. Although there is much information available about chronic pain, there is evidence that nurses find patients with chronic pain difficult to work with. This article assists nurses to maintain and develop their practice by addressing these issues.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
